  "kind": "recipe",
  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "abliterated",
    "description": "drowzeys' community compile for one Spark: sakamakismile's uniform NVFP4 quantization of AEON-7's uncensored (abliterated) Qwen3.8 27B, IncoAI's DFlash2 draft at n=7, a cybersecurity-unlock chat template, and a 1,048,576-token window by YaRN x4 (nested rope hf-overrides plus a YaRN-extended drafter config, because vLLM does not stretch the draft rope past 262144). Runs AEON-7's aeon-vllm-ultimate as retagged by drowzeys. Defaults follow upstream's 1M seat (serve_b5_on_4.sh): 2 sequences, GPU memory 0.70, 8192 batched tokens, FP8 KV, Triton attention, no prefix caching, sampling temperature 0.6 top-p 0.95 top-k 20 repetition penalty 1.05. Upstream reports (not measured here): needle hit at 999,714 tokens, 1,113,770-token KV pool, cyber 8/8 and refusal 32/32, prose decode about 20 and code about 42 tok/s. Uncensored weights and an unlock template: users supply their own guardrails; upstream ships a Responsible Use agreement (RESPONSIBLE_USE.md, vendored). Licences: weights and draft Apache-2.0 per their model cards, drowzeys repository Apache-2.0 (LICENSE vendored). Not gated. Upstream's second seat (16k, 64 sequences) is available as an option; set the context and concurrency settings to 16384 and 64 with it.",
    "tags": [
      "abliterated",
      "candidate",
      "dflash2",
      "executable",
      "mtp",
      "multimodal",
      "nvfp4",
      "qwen3.8",
      "single",
      "spark",
      "tool-use",
      "uncensored",
      "vllm",
      "yarn"
    ],
    "title": "Qwen3.8 27B AEON Uncensored NVFP4 DFlash2 1M YaRN vLLM one Spark (drowzeys)"
